  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'ABOUT THE GAME


    A standard night shift. Simple, routine work that
    shouldn''t raise any questions. Yet, the longer you stay alone with your thoughts
    in the quiet corridors, the harder it becomes to separate reality from illusion.


    THE
    CONCEPT


    This project is an exploration of isolation, burnout, and the illusion
    of control. We cling to familiar tasks to maintain a sense of order, even when
    everything around us begins to fracture. It is a game about silence, psychological
    tension, and what lingers just beyond sight.


    Created solo for a Game Jam
    by an independent game developer from Ukraine. As this project was built under
    a tight deadline, I sincerely apologize if you encounter any bugs. I would be
    truly grateful for any bug reports and feedback, and I genuinely hope you enjoy
    the game!'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
